{"title":"2006.06831 Algorithmic Recourse under Imperfect Causal Knowledge: A Probabilistic Approach","markdown":{"headingText":"2006.06831 Algorithmic Recourse under Imperfect Causal Knowledge: A Probabilistic Approach","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"- 作者/日期/来源：Amir-Hossein Karimi, Julius von Kügelgen, Bernhard Schölkopf, Isabel Valera；2020-06-11（v3 2020-10-23，NeurIPS 2020）；arXiv:2006.06831\n- **一句话定位**：证明在不知道真实结构方程时算法追索（algorithmic recourse）原则上无法保证，并提出两种概率化方法——基于高斯过程的反事实分布估计与基于子人群干预（CATE）的追索——在不完全因果知识下高概率地达成追索。\n- **研究问题**：被算法拒绝贷款的个体 x^F 应执行哪些干预动作 a=do(X_I=θ)、以最小代价使预测翻盘？此前工作（Karimi et al. 2020）需完整已知结构因果模型（structural causal model, SCM）才能计算反事实，而真实结构方程通常不可知且其函数形式假设不可检验。\n- **模型与方法**：SCM M=(S,P_U)，S={X_r:=f_r(X_pa(r),U_r)}，噪声独立（因果充分性），因果图 G 已知。加性噪声模型 X_r=f_r(X_pa(r))+U_r。方法一（个体化，梯级 3）：定义 GP-SCM（Def. 4）：f_r~GP(0,k_r)、U_r~N(0,σ_r²)，用贝叶斯模型平均得到噪声后验与反事实分布（Prop. 5/6 给出解析形式），把硬约束 h(x)≥0.5 换成期望约束 E_{X_SCF(a)}[h]≥thresh(a)，thresh 取下置信界 0.5+γ_LCB·√Var[h]。方法二（子人群化，梯级 2）：放弃结构方程假设，条件于非后代变量 X_nd(I)=x^F_nd(I) 选出与 x^F 相似的子人群，用干预分布 E_{X_d(I)|do}[h] 定义追索，干预分布可由因果马尔可夫核分解识别（Prop. 7），各条件分布 p(x_r|x_pa(r)) 用条件变分自编码器（conditional VAE, CVAE）估计。两者均可重参数化，用拉格朗日鞍点 + 随机梯度求最优 θ（目标组合合枚举或并行）。\n- **主要命题/定理**：Example 1（改编自 Pearl《因果学》Prop. 6.19）构造 M_A、M_B：X_3 的方程仅在 X_1=X_2 分支使用 U_3 与 K−U_3 之别，两模型观测与干预分布完全相同、数据上不可区分，但对 x^F=(1,0,0) 的反事实分别为 0 与 K，说明结构方程形式不可检验。Prop. 2（负面结果）：除非被干预变量无后代，只有已知真实结构方程才能保证追索。实验（3 变量线性/非线性 ANM/非加性 SCM，100 次运行、100 个 MC 样本、γ_LCB=2）：点估计方法在假设失配时有效性骤降（M_LIN 在非线性 ANM 上仅 54%）；M_GP 与 M_CVAE 在线性与非线性 ANM 上有效性 100%；非加性 SCM 上仅子人群方法 CATE_CVAE 达到 100% 有效性（GP 假设被违反时降至 95%），代价是成本略高。7 变量半合成 German Credit 贷款 SCM 上结论一致（M_GP/M_CVAE 有效性 100% vs M_LIN 19–94%），γ_LCB 可调控有效性—成本权衡。\n- **在因果研究脉络中的角色**：把 Pearl 因果阶梯的梯级 2 与梯级 3 之别落到\"可解释 ML/追索\"这一应用上，指出反事实推理对不可检验的参数假设的脆弱性，并以\"子人群干预\"作为可识别的替代目标；是因果追索方向被广泛引用的基准工作。\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","output-file":"2006.06831.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"目录","toc-title-website":"该页面内容","related-formats-title":"其他格式","related-notebooks-title":"笔记本","source-notebooks-prefix":"资源","other-links-title":"其他链接","code-links-title":"代码链接","launch-dev-container-title":"启动 Dev Container","launch-binder-title":"启动 Binder","article-notebook-label":"文章笔记本","notebook-preview-download":"下载笔记本","notebook-preview-download-src":"下载源代码","notebook-preview-back":"返回文章","manuscript-meca-bundle":"MECA 存档","section-title-abstract":"摘要","section-title-appendices":"附录","section-title-footnotes":"脚注","section-title-references":"参考文献","section-title-reuse":"二次使用","section-title-copyright":"版权","section-title-citation":"引用格式","appendix-attribution-cite-as":"请按如下格式引用：","appendix-attribution-bibtex":"BibTeX","appendix-v